<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Note on Language Editing</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the preparation of this paper, we used ChatGPT to improve the clarity, grammar, and style of the writing. This tool was specifically employed for the purposes of refining and editing the text; it was not used to generate ideas, content, or contribute to the research itself.</p>
</div>
